===Etymology===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term|hovit|hōvit|lang=odt}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{recons|haubudan|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɦoːft/|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-hoofd.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|n|hoofden|hoofdje}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=nl}} [[head]] &ndash; of the body
# [[head]] (''of an organisation''), [[chief]], [[boss]]
# a breakwater, jetty or pier at the entrance of a sea harbour 

====Derived terms====
These are derived terms from the meaning "the head of a body". The prefix "[[hoofd-]]" means "main, head, chief", so words derived from that meaning are listed on ''[[hoofd-]]''.
{{top4}}
* [[hoofdpijn]]
* [[uit het hoofd]]
* [[staatshoofd]]
{{mid2}}
* [[voorhoofd]]
* [[havenhoofd]]
{{bottom}}

